{"text": "Every input from a donor is a canonical element. Every anomaly is linked to at least one proverb. No wisdom element is auto-ratified.", "type": "principle", "weight": "load-bearing", "source_file": "R7M/WISDOM_CANON.md", "source_line": 27}
